N:All grace notes except the last are demi-semiquavers, but the program
N:won't show them as that!  The last one is a crotchet.  The pauses are
N:shown as the standard pause marks.
N:There are dots scattered everywhere, it is not clear what is dotted and
N:what isn't. Therefore there may not be the right number of beats in a
N:bar, and bar
N:3, no matter what combination of dots and nots I tried, never added up.
N:There are squiggles over the 7th and 8th notes in the first full bar on
N:the second lin
Z:vmp.Cherri Graebe.
B:Village Music project, Browne13
